    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="N7a61eef243ca4dca9fa951a9f4257789"/>
    <rdfs:comment>A Role is the abstract representation of how an Entity participates in a Relationship. Each relationship definition should be associated with a subjectRole and an objectRole.
The relationship's multiplicity (cardinality + optionality) properties are recorded against the role, as are any key-definitions used to implement the role.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="Nb326e646d6fb499db96fba7bd5b7343e">
